  - m_Id: 7254476872839187
    m_Localized: choose your color
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7254476872839188
    m_Localized: how to play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7254476872839189
    m_Localized: Sidjah is an ancient logic board game for two players, widespread
      in northeast Africa and Saudi Arabia. Two people are playing. Each player has
      12 chips. The goal of the game is to capture at least 11 enemy chips.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7254476872839190
    m_Localized: 'The game is played in two phases. The first phase: placement. Players
      alternately place two chips on any two cells of the field, except the central
      one.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7254476872839191
    m_Localized: 'After the placement, the second phase begins: the battle. The player
      who started the placement also makes the first move to the central cell. The
      chip moves in any direction (including diagonally) for one cell, if it is free.
      You can''t skip a move.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7254476872839192
    m_Localized: After a move if the opponent's chip falls between two chips of an
      active player, then it is considered captured and removed from the field. Moreover,
      all chips in all directions (vertically, horizontally and diagonally) are considered
      captured at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7254476872839193
    m_Localized: Chips that are initially sandwiched between the opponent's chips
      are not captured, as well as their own chip placed by the player between two
      opponent's chips.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7254476872839194
    m_Localized: When the opponent has less than two chips left on the field, victory
      is yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7254476872839195
    m_Localized: next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7254476872839196
    m_Localized: congratulation!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7254476872839197
    m_Localized: you win
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7254476872839198
    m_Localized: confirm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7254476872839199
    m_Localized: game is over
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7254476872839200
    m_Localized: unfortunately, you lost, you'll be lucky another time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
